        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 99, Classic Leverset with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional lines and enhanced styling of the Omnia 99 Classic Lever makes it a great choice for many design intents. Since it is available in 7 finishes, you'll be sure to find one to match your decor. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden); and it covers any standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door preparation. It will fit 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\" or 2\" door thicknesses with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Door Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 99 Classic Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MHE-brass-pinapple.jpg?v=1704354543\" width=\"600\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Leverset",
                "description": "Omnia 99/00 Classic Leverset - The classic lines and enhanced styling of the 99 Omnia Lever make it a great choice for many design intents. Since it is available in 7 finishes, you'll be sure to find one to match your decor. The circular rose has concealed screw mounting (installation screws are hidden); and it covers any standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparation. It will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch or 2 inch door thicknesses with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "OMN-99/00, Omnia traditional door levers, Elegant door lever latchsets, Omnia 946 door levers, brass circular door levers, simple door levers, Omnia solid brass door lever latchsets, solid brass door levers, passage levers, privacy levers, dummy levers, omnia posh levers, omnia 99 Classic Levers, 99/00 omnia levers, omnia traditions collection"
